'' ===========================================================================
''
''   File.......  ch03-blink-led.spin2
''   Purpose....  The first program - a pin driven high and low on a
''                timer, and nothing else to distract from it
''   Manual.....  Getting Started with the Propeller 2
''   Version....  v1.0.3 (2026-08-08)
''   Appears in.  Chapter 3: Putting It to Work -- Your first program:
''                drive a pin
''   Authors....  Iron Sheep Productions, LLC
''   E-mail.....  stephen@ironsheep.biz
''   Started....  Jun 2026
''   Updated....  Jul 2026
''
''   This file is an EXAMPLE from the manual above. Everything below
''   this header is byte-identical to the listing printed there --
''   what you read in the manual is what builds here.
''
'' ===========================================================================

CON
  _clkfreq = 200_000_000        ' system clock: 200 MHz
  LED      = 56                 ' the pin our LED is on

PUB main()
  repeat                        ' do this forever
    pinhigh(LED)                ' LED on
    waitms(250)                 ' wait a quarter second
    pinlow(LED)                 ' LED off
    waitms(250)

